id\":444149,\"title\":\"Hellraiser: Judgment\",\"year\":2018,\"rating\":5.1}]},\"similar\":[{\"id\":1400940,\"title\":\"Clayface\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9l1NuFjel2j89hiuiJbsxfblqjy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f1TVhqJJdxMvUsUDuKHS0ekgYkk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt Hagen's meteoric rise from Gotham street kid to Hollywood leading man is tragically cut short when a local crime boss's actions leave him horribly disfigured. Abandoned by his team and with nothing left, Matt seeks out a cutting edge treatment that miraculously returns him to his former self… but also unexpectedly affects his grip on reality, spiraling him down a destructive path of all-consuming revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100988,\"title\":\"28 Years Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n5FygjEppOvac6yEaowi26nTyw3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6WqqEjiycNvDLjbEClM1zCwIbDD.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight years after the Rage virus outbreak, a heavily-defended island survives connected to the mainland by a single causeway. When one of the group leaves the island into the dark heart of the mainland, he discovers secrets, wonders, and horrors that have mutated not only the infected but other survivors as well.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":170,\"title\":\"28 Days Later\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sQckQRt17VaWbo39GIu0TMOiszq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJFwk1clMal1prxAvKAgHxKPAf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-eight days after a killer virus was accidentally unleashed from a British research facility, a small group of London survivors are caught in a desperate struggle to protect themselves from the infected. Carried by animals and humans, the virus turns those it infects into homicidal maniacs -- and it's absolutely impossible to contain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084199,\"title\":\"Companion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oCoTgC3UyWGfyQ9thE10ulWR7bn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sc1abgWNXc29wSBaerrjGBih06l.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During a weekend getaway at a secluded lakeside estate, a group of friends finds themselves entangled in a web of secrets, deception, and advanced technology. As tensions rise and loyalties are tested, they uncover unsettling truths about themselves and the world around them.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1064028,\"title\":\"Subservience\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gBenxR01Uy0Ev9RTIw6dVBPoyQU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/co7oxvpWxgd6FZU24DnljDDHYQA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With his wife out sick, a struggling father brings home a lifelike AI, only to have his self-aware new help want everything her new family has to offer... Like the affection of her owner and she'll kill to get it.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":520763,\"title\":\"A Quiet Place Part II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4q2hz2m8hubgvijz8Ez0T2Os2Yv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uuBYYlbfiYD7ny5VNj46NG14ykR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the events at home, the Abbott family now face the terrors of the outside world. Forced to venture into the unknown, they realize that the creatures that hunt by sound are not the only threats that lurk beyond the sand path.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1307118,\"title\":\"Soulm8te\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aRfFP8stzodl0bo8ywoNZXdaVwo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7t6f6VxA2ZXbbZSVctgt7bZG2DI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a ruthless tech giant acquires a small robotics company, a grieving engineer is tasked with testing their new AI companion. But when he attempts to reprogram her to be a truly sentient soulmate, she develops needs of her own—unleashing a relentless spree of precision-engineered mayhem.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604079,\"title\":\"The Long Walk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wobVTa99eW0ht6c1rNNzLkazPtR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jyghveaMeSnTMFKT2ZebfVymhET.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian America, fifty teenage boys take part in a deadly annual walking contest, forced to maintain a minimum pace or be executed, until only one survivor remains.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":5876,\"title\":\"The Mist\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c4UgUKZjM0Qzy5t4hAXSOFHYsnb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/76J14zgwVWyOciri7X7F3DGP3TA.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a violent storm, a dense cloud of mist envelops a small Maine town, trapping David Drayton and his five-year-old son in a local grocery store with other local residents. They soon discover that the mist conceals deadly horrors that threaten their lives, and worse, their sanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":158015,\"title\":\"The Purge\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x6hwbnR2nGacSzljqYaXY25w1Me.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/anFRs7Xi7u2nqqBpmhqvXINAPix.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Given the country's overcrowded prisons, the U.S. government begins to allow 12-hour periods of time in which all illegal activity is legal. During one of these free-for-alls, a family must protect themselves from a home invasion.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4858,\"title\":\"The Invasion\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oS5rMuJXwNZZPx0ojhvjgduglD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nPpIFyRRe33xKUj3nEHZZbz364x.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Washington, D.C. psychologist Carol Bennell and her colleague Dr. Ben Driscoll are the only two people on Earth who are aware of an epidemic running rampant through the city. They discover an alien virus aboard a crashed space shuttle that transforms anyone who comes into contact with it into unfeeling drones while they sleep. Carol realizes her son holds the key to stopping the spread of the plague and she races to find him before it is too late.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":460019,\"title\":\"Truth or Dare\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ei2waWQAG8NP244WShIFgGu9IOu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eQ5xu2pQ5Kergubto5PbbUzey28.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A harmless game of \\\"Truth or Dare\\\" among friends turns deadly when someone—or something—begins to punish those who tell a lie—or refuse the dare.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"NoU_IizY9GM\",\"name\":\"Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}